---
// "Let's talk" split section with the mascot blob.
---

<section
  class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-[30px] items-center max-w-[900px] mx-auto mt-[60px] mb-[30px] px-5"
>
  <div class="grid place-items-center">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" class="w-[200px] h-[200px]">
      <path
        fill="#2fae57"
        stroke="#111"
        stroke-width="2"
        d="M100,20 C150,20 185,55 175,105 C168,140 150,180 100,180 C50,180 30,140 25,100 C20,55 50,20 100,20 Z"
      ></path>
      <circle cx="80" cy="95" r="7" fill="#111"></circle>
      <circle cx="118" cy="95" r="7" fill="#111"></circle>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h2 class="font-display m-0 mb-[14px]" style="font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,60px);">
      LET'S TALK
    </h2>
    <p class="text-[14px] leading-[1.6] max-w-[340px]">
      I'm most energized by projects where I can dig into complex problems,
      collaborate with smart people, and ship things that genuinely improve
      someone's day.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
